    style="width: 100%; max-width: 480px; border-radius: 10px; margin: 12px 0 20px 0;"
  />

  <p style="max-width: 75ch;">
    At 8:30, three teenagers showed up to make vlogs, which broke the idyllic solitude I'd been enjoying. It turned out to be a good thing. Sleeping up there completely alone, with the wind working on the shutters all night, would have been scary without them. I fell asleep soon after.
  </p>

